 "check": {
  "describe": "Dark, tablet landscape (1280x800): DEPARTURES in amber with ABFAHRT · DÉPARTS · PARTENZE, a five-tile flap clock at the top right reading 08:41, column labels, nine rows of dark flap tiles with warm white letters and a split line: 08:42 MILANO C.LE EC 31 4 BOARDING (amber, blinking lamp), 08:47 ZURICH HB IC 718 7 BOARDING, 08:55 MUNCHEN HBF RJ 64 12 DELAYED (orange), 09:03 STRASBOURG TGV 9 ON TIME (green), ... 09:18 GENEVE IR 15 CANCELED (red); an amber ticker band at the bottom. flip (t = 9.75 s): the board moving up one train, tiles caught mid-flip through other letters (ZURI77, FU-1H2N), some showing half flaps, status flaps white while turning. intro (t = 0.6 s): most tiles still blank or showing early letters A, B, C. Phone landscape 640x360: five rows, no train column. Phone portrait 360x640 and tablet portrait 800x1280: two lines per train, status, train and platform under the destination. Light: white flaps with charcoal letters on a warm grey wall, a darker amber title, deeper status colours (green, amber, orange, red), a black ticker with amber letters. Mono dark and mono light: every tile an outline with the split cut through it, no colour and no motion; the status is the word plus a lamp shape: ring for ON TIME, disc for BOARDING, half disc for DELAYED, slashed ring for CANCELED; the ticker under a single rule.",
